      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA ENVY (2) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and two minors from six tries. Hit the frame latest (30.62) when third at Angle Park in a OPEN. Looks suited and should go close. WEBLEC JOEL (4) finished sixth last time at Wentworth Park but could not have been more impressive before that in his swift 29.96 win at The Meadows over 525m. Expected to feature on best figures. PAW LOVISA (8) is an honest type in the frame at 12 of 31 starts including nine wins, the latest scoring (27.66) over 485m at Horsham. Has a good record here including five wins. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. VICTORY BARRY (3) drops in journey and should be in the mix.",
